<%- include('../partials/head',{title:'Terms'}) %><%- include('../partials/public-nav') %><main class="public-page"><section class="page-hero"><div class="public-container narrow"><span class="eyebrow light">Terms</span><h1>ReLoop Platform Terms</h1></div></section><section class="public-section"><div class="public-container narrow prose"><p><b>Launch note:</b> This package includes a practical baseline terms page but final public terms should be reviewed for the exact legal entity, payment arrangements, refund rules and applicable Ugandan law before launch.</p><h2>Platform role</h2><p>ReLoop coordinates recycling requests, collection activities, partner deliveries and related marketplace records. Availability of services may depend on location, material and partner capacity.</p><h2>User responsibilities</h2><p>Users must provide accurate information, avoid fraudulent listings or payment claims, and treat other participants respectfully.</p><h2>Weights and transactions</h2><p>Customer estimates are not final. Collected and verified weights may differ and are stored separately. Any payment shown as pending is not considered paid until verification is completed.</p><h2>Disputes and refunds</h2><p>Disputes are reviewed case by case. Refunds, where applicable, should follow the confirmed payment-provider record and ReLoop’s final commercial policy.</p><h2>Safety</h2><p>ReLoop may suspend users for fraud, harassment, unsafe conduct or abuse of the platform.</p></div></section></main><%- include('../partials/foot') %>
